    "Maven re-downloads dependencies; anything you `mvn install`ed locally is lost" : {
      "comment" : "Shown for a cache location: what happens after it is cleaned, or how to get it back",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "يعيد Maven تنزيل التبعيات؛ يُفقد كل ما ثبّته محليًا باستخدام `mvn install`"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Maven lädt Abhängigkeiten erneut; alles, was Sie lokal mit `mvn install` installiert haben, geht verloren"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Maven vuelve a descargar las dependencias; se pierde todo lo que hayas instalado localmente con `mvn install`"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Maven retélécharge les dépendances ; tout ce que vous avez installé localement avec `mvn install` est perdu"
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Maven מוריד תלויות שוב; כל מה שהתקנת מקומית עם `mvn install` אובד"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Mavenは依存関係を再ダウンロードします。ローカルに`mvn install`したものは失われます"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Maven이 의존성을 다시 다운로드합니다. 로컬에서 `mvn install`한 항목은 사라집니다"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "O Maven baixa as dependências de novo; o que você instalou localmente com `mvn install` se perde"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Maven 会重新下载依赖；你通过 `mvn install` 本地安装的内容会丢失"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Maven 會重新下載相依項目；你在本機 `mvn install` 的內容將會遺失"
          }
        }
      }
    },
